  "title": "Orbit Salvage",
  "rules": [
    "Three tugs share a heavy salvage body with bounded integer inertia. Two aligned attached thrusts are needed for one unit of acceleration.",
    "Action 6 latches or releases before force aggregation; attached offsets move rigidly with the cargo. Fuel and all geometric state are public.",
    "The assembly resolves first against boundaries and old free-tug cells. Free tugs then avoid the settled assembly and old free-tug positions; contested free targets reject all contenders.",
    "A two-tug brake can arrest shared momentum. Cargo docks only at an exact port with zero velocity, at least two attachments and an open window.",
    "Dock values are private. Only each role observation reveals its preferred port; the scene does not expose peers values.",
    "AUTHOR SOURCE ONLY: native state and scene mappings are supplied, but no replay, animation, causal effect or learning result has been executed."
  ],
